# Domain Entities — Unit: pr-review-agent

Technology-agnostic domain model for the autonomous PR review agent.

## Entity: PullRequestContext
Represents the PR under review and the metadata needed to fetch its diff and post results.

| Attribute | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| repo_owner | string | GitHub repository owner |
| repo_name | string | GitHub repository name |
| pr_number | integer | Pull request number |
| head_sha | string | Commit SHA of the PR head (target for the status check) |
| base_ref | string | Base branch (expected: `dev`) |

## Entity: DiffFile
A single file's changes within the PR diff.

| Attribute | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| path | string | File path |
| language | string | Detected language (python, typescript, yaml, other) |
| patch | string | Unified diff hunk text for the file |
| added_lines | integer | Count of added lines |
| removed_lines | integer | Count of removed lines |

## Entity: ReviewInput
The aggregated, size-bounded input handed to the review engine (Kiro CLI headless).

| Attribute | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| files | list[DiffFile] | Files included in the review |
| total_diff_bytes | integer | Total size of included diff |
| truncated | boolean | Always false in current design (oversized PRs are skipped, not truncated — Q4=C) |

## Entity: Finding
A single issue identified by the review engine (Kiro CLI headless).

| Attribute | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| severity | Severity | One of: High, Medium, Low, Info (Q1=B) |
| category | string | One of: quality, correctness, security |
| file_path | string \| null | File the finding refers to (null for repo-wide) |
| line | integer \| null | Line number if applicable (for inline comments) |
| title | string | Short summary of the issue |
| detail | string | Explanation and suggested fix |

## Value Object: Severity (enumeration)
Ordered, highest to lowest: `High > Medium > Low > Info`. (Q1=B — 4 levels)

## Entity: ReviewResult
The outcome of a review, driving comments, status check, and approval.

| Attribute | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| findings | list[Finding] | All findings |
| verdict | Verdict | Computed decision (see business rules) |
| summary_markdown | string | Human-readable summary comment body |
| error | string \| null | Populated when the agent failed (drives fail-closed behavior) |

## Value Object: Verdict (enumeration)
- `APPROVE` — zero findings (Q3=A) → post approval review + passing status check
- `COMMENT` — findings exist but none are blocking (no High) → post comments, neutral/passing status check, no approval
- `BLOCK` — at least one High finding (Q2=A) → post comments + request-changes/failing status check
- `SKIPPED_TOO_LARGE` — PR diff exceeded the size budget (Q4=C) → post informational comment, non-blocking passing check
- `ERROR` — agent failed (Q5=A) → failing status check (fail closed)

## Relationships (text)

```
PullRequestContext 1 --- * DiffFile
DiffFile *          --- 1 ReviewInput (aggregation, size-bounded)
ReviewInput 1       --> 1 ReviewResult (produced by Kiro CLI call + parsing)
ReviewResult 1      --- * Finding
ReviewResult 1      --- 1 Verdict (computed from findings/error/size)
```
